{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake alone in a bunker on an alien world, with no memory of the last six months or how you got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contacts are confused chat messages from a handful of other souls in the same situation as you, and mysterious commands issued by the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's something moving outside. Something big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In They Walk Beyond, you'll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember and follow a set of strange commands within a time limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the power and integrity of your bunker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep yourself fed and hydrated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wonder what kind of cheap-ass interstellar mining company still uses CRT monitors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the stories of the others stranded just like you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to piece together what's going on and how you got here</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Hopefully.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952570?t=1759263180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952570?t=1759263180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952570/6fc03d4fee26752b38d6eae9637e0169c0a62c8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759263180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952570/6fc03d4fee26752b38d6eae9637e0169c0a62c8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759263180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"While not a jumpscare game, They Walk Beyond contains startling sounds, flashing lights, and frightening alien imagery. There are also themes of isolation, psychological horror, and mild profanity."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake alone in a bunker on an alien world, with no memory of the last six months or how you got there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contacts are confused chat messages from a handful of other souls in the same situation as you, and mysterious commands issued by the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there's something moving outside. Something big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In They Walk Beyond, you'll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember and follow a set of strange commands within a time limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the power and integrity of your bunker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep yourself fed and hydrated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wonder what kind of cheap-ass interstellar mining company still uses CRT monitors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the stories of the others stranded just like you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to piece together what's going on and how you got here</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Hopefully.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Red Nebula Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952570/f7e39ae507868f93fc51370538cf78a08ada6d93/header.jpg?t=1759263180","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3952570/1090890855/08994b156475842e449aa17d9690067a5ff47a41/1759260043/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759263178","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.